### settle withdraw stops for --yes
$ devnet-dvpn settle withdraw
Move your refundable balance back to your wallet.
Re-run with --yes to do it.
(exit 2)

### daemon repair-drivers stops for --yes
$ devnet-dvpn daemon repair-drivers
Install or repair WireGuard, AmneziaWG, OpenVPN and nftables with apt (one administrator prompt). Tools already installed are left alone.
Re-run with --yes to do it.
(exit 2)

